1
00:00:02,473 --> 00:00:04,305
Everyone takes backups.

2
00:00:04,305 --> 00:00:06,589
Far fewer have ever put one back.

3
00:00:06,589 --> 00:00:08,623
Hand it a backup file.

4
00:00:08,623 --> 00:00:12,657
It says what it is about to replace, and asks first.

5
00:00:12,657 --> 00:00:16,421
And it tells you what came back.

6
00:00:16,421 --> 00:00:18,826
No ticket. No waiting on someone else.
